Drop â†’ project screenâ†’canvas coords â†’ insert with registry defaults. One generic `NodeCard.vue`: category strip, icon, label, typed handles, placeholder status/validation badges. Move, multi-select, group move, Delete key, 20px snap grid, minimap colored by category, controls, fit-to-view, dagre tidy-up button.
