The existing storage model makes this a cross-cutting feature: workflow definitions and execution records live under `output/workflows`, while project artifacts live elsewhere under `output/<project_id>` and branding is shared. I’m mapping references and current UI/API patterns now so the archive stays portable, rejects unsafe files, and can restore without weakening ID/path validation.
