I’ve settled the archive contract around a ZIP with a versioned manifest and SHA-256 inventory. Export is scoped by saved workflow plus strict project ID; restore supports preserving or regenerating both workflow and project IDs, rewrites document/path references, validates the restored workflow, and refuses traversal, symlinks, duplicate members, corrupt hashes, and unsafe overwrites.
